WEBVTT

01:28.281 --> 01:32.321
Our Secret
EP07

01:44.881 --> 01:45.640
Siyue

01:45.920 --> 01:48.241
Let's play billiards this Sunday.

01:49.071 --> 01:49.831
What are you planning?

01:50.110 --> 01:51.041
Count me in.

01:51.281 --> 01:52.151
I'll think about it.

01:52.640 --> 01:54.001
The math competition is approaching.

01:55.390 --> 01:56.881
Xianxian, you can join us.

01:57.071 --> 01:58.920
I can't play billiards.

01:59.110 --> 02:00.321
Neither can I.

02:00.961 --> 02:02.001
Anyway,

02:02.191 --> 02:04.111
you just aim at the billiard ball and poke it.

02:05.191 --> 02:06.681
That's so embarrassing. I don't want to go with you.

02:06.831 --> 02:07.791
Oh my!

02:07.961 --> 02:09.791
I don't want to go with you, either.

02:15.481 --> 02:16.551
Well, let's go with them.

02:17.151 --> 02:18.431
I can teach you how to play billiards.

02:21.401 --> 02:22.201
Yeah!

02:23.841 --> 02:26.401
How about asking Jiang Chen to join us?

02:26.601 --> 02:27.351
Forget it.

02:27.841 --> 02:29.431
He's too good at it. We don't want to embarrass ourselves.

02:30.631 --> 02:32.991
If you can't see clearly, just tell me.

02:48.321 --> 02:50.071
I can take the notes for you.

02:50.511 --> 02:52.710
You need to focus on your competition paper.

02:53.121 --> 02:54.631
I can finish it on time.

03:04.681 --> 03:05.791
Dinner is ready.

03:06.791 --> 03:07.151
I'm coming.

03:07.151 --> 03:08.321
Hurry up.

03:15.511 --> 03:16.321
Here you are.

03:19.681 --> 03:20.631
Mom

03:21.151 --> 03:23.121
I want to discuss something with you.

03:25.121 --> 03:27.911
I want to change a pair of stronger glasses.

03:28.551 --> 03:29.841
Your nearsightedness has gotten worse?

03:30.601 --> 03:31.601
Yeah.

03:31.761 --> 03:35.431
Xianxian, it was just pseudo myopia before.

03:35.631 --> 03:37.071
Wearing glasses is to correct visual acuity.

03:37.241 --> 03:39.071
How could it get worse?

03:39.631 --> 03:42.351
I have no idea. I can't see clearly sometimes.

03:42.960 --> 03:44.601
Which row of seats are you in now?

03:46.631 --> 03:47.791
The fifth one.

03:48.041 --> 03:49.321
Then you can talk to your teacher

03:49.631 --> 03:51.271
to move your seat to the front row.

03:52.511 --> 03:53.631
You'd better

03:53.841 --> 03:55.321
not depend too much on glasses.

03:55.601 --> 03:57.201
If your nearsightedness keeps getting worse,

03:57.511 --> 03:59.481
you have to wear glasses all the time.

04:01.791 --> 04:02.961
If you don't want to talk to the teacher yourself,

04:03.121 --> 04:04.201
I can talk to him about it.

04:05.071 --> 04:07.761
No. Forget it.

04:10.991 --> 04:12.071
You dad told me that

04:12.711 --> 04:14.761
the science-arts division is coming.

04:16.201 --> 04:17.231
It comes just in time.

04:17.391 --> 04:19.081
When you are in the arts class,

04:19.271 --> 04:20.111
you can sit in the front row.

04:20.271 --> 04:21.201
All will be settled then.

04:21.951 --> 04:24.641
But I may choose science, too.

04:30.671 --> 04:32.801
You are a girl. How can you learn science?

04:33.801 --> 04:36.521
Why can't girls learn science?

04:36.801 --> 04:38.801
I don't mean that girls can't learn science.

04:39.111 --> 04:41.391
It's just girls are usually not good at learning science courses.

04:43.151 --> 04:43.761
You must think that

04:43.921 --> 04:45.921
there is little difference between your academic performance on the two courses.

04:46.111 --> 04:48.521
The science courses will be much more difficult in the junior and senior years.

04:49.391 --> 04:49.761
But ......

04:49.921 --> 04:51.711
That's enough.

04:51.921 --> 04:54.231
I have made the decision for you. Choose the arts class.

04:54.951 --> 04:56.201
How can you say that?

04:56.831 --> 04:58.671
This is my own business.

04:59.641 --> 05:00.991
Don't I have the right to

05:01.151 --> 05:02.231
make my own choice?

05:02.431 --> 05:04.551
You don't know how to make a better choice.

05:06.201 --> 05:08.641
I'm only telling you this for your own good!

05:08.831 --> 05:10.551
And you dad can help you with the courses.

05:10.881 --> 05:12.921
So you can go to a better college.

05:13.361 --> 05:14.921
We did this all

05:15.481 --> 05:17.391
for your own good!

05:17.551 --> 05:19.111
Stop arguing with me.

05:19.361 --> 05:20.111
That's enough.

05:20.391 --> 05:22.081
Calm down.

05:22.431 --> 05:24.111
It is a very big deal.

05:24.271 --> 05:26.601
We should talk it over.

05:27.081 --> 05:28.201
Xianxian

05:30.111 --> 05:31.761
Don't talk to your mom like that!

05:37.641 --> 05:38.801
I'm full.

05:46.391 --> 05:48.951
You can't educate children like that.

05:49.111 --> 05:50.201
You are good at educating.

05:50.431 --> 05:51.711
You really did a good job,

05:52.431 --> 05:54.201
and she just left the table like that.

06:06.881 --> 06:08.361
Xianxian, come online quickly.

06:08.801 --> 06:10.711
Accept my friend request online.

06:22.711 --> 06:23.991
Welcome Little Monster.

06:38.521 --> 06:40.991
Put down your cell phone and do your homework carefully.

06:46.231 --> 06:47.231
Xianxian

06:49.671 --> 06:52.271
You told mom that you want a phone

06:52.481 --> 06:54.111
a few days ago.

06:55.111 --> 06:56.481
And we bought you

06:56.881 --> 06:58.040
this one.

07:01.711 --> 07:02.831
What's wrong?

07:05.951 --> 07:07.231
Sorry, dad.

07:10.041 --> 07:11.521
I lied to you.

07:12.671 --> 07:13.831
About what?

07:25.481 --> 07:28.271
Zhou Siyue lent me this.

07:29.431 --> 07:31.391
I saw it this morning.

07:32.481 --> 07:33.431
Well,

07:33.601 --> 07:34.641
just return it

07:34.801 --> 07:36.431
to him later.

07:41.481 --> 07:42.521
Xianxian

07:42.881 --> 07:45.231
Since we have bought you this mobile phone,

07:45.391 --> 07:47.271
I'd like to make some rules for you.

07:48.481 --> 07:49.521
First,

07:49.761 --> 07:51.881
don't bring the phone to school.

07:52.040 --> 07:53.081
It will distract you.

07:54.761 --> 07:56.081
Second,

07:57.551 --> 07:59.671
I hope you can think about

08:00.081 --> 08:01.991
what your mom said to you just now.

08:02.951 --> 08:05.321
She had a point there.

08:07.481 --> 08:10.921
Dad, you also think

08:11.881 --> 08:14.081
I should choose arts?

08:16.991 --> 08:19.081
I have the same idea as your mother.

08:19.481 --> 08:21.831
It's just that girls may suffer more

08:21.991 --> 08:23.551
to learn science courses.

08:23.801 --> 08:25.671
And we don't want you to go through this.

08:26.111 --> 08:27.521
How about you, dad?

08:27.951 --> 08:29.881
Why did you choose to major in politics?

08:30.271 --> 08:30.991
Me?

08:33.351 --> 08:36.161
I was not good at science courses.

08:36.430 --> 08:37.961
And it shows exactly that

08:38.161 --> 08:39.841
girls are good at arts courses

08:39.991 --> 08:41.281
while boys are good at science courses

08:41.401 --> 08:43.471
is not a correct theory.

08:47.431 --> 08:48.521
By the way,

08:49.111 --> 08:51.721
I get angry not because you don't want me to learn science.

08:52.721 --> 08:55.161
I'm angry because you don't let me make the choice myself.

09:02.031 --> 09:03.111
Xianxian

09:03.671 --> 09:05.591
We did this because

09:06.431 --> 09:08.161
we are afraid that you will make a wrong choice

09:08.761 --> 09:10.961
and can't bear the consequences it may cause.

09:13.911 --> 09:16.911
If you've made your determination,

09:18.351 --> 09:19.351
I'll

09:19.521 --> 09:20.841
respect your decision.

09:29.551 --> 09:30.911
Thank you, dad.

09:32.351 --> 09:33.351
And, yeah,

09:33.721 --> 09:36.201
don't be angry with your mother anymore.

09:36.401 --> 09:37.521
Her bark is worse than her bite.

09:37.671 --> 09:38.761
You know that.

09:39.031 --> 09:40.111
And

09:40.431 --> 09:44.111
I think she may be going through menopause.

09:46.321 --> 09:47.351
Okay.

09:47.791 --> 09:49.401
I'm not mad at her anymore.

09:51.351 --> 09:52.031
Honey.

09:52.281 --> 09:53.281
You may do your homework now.

10:13.761 --> 10:14.991
Hello, senior.

10:15.991 --> 10:17.431
Could you please do me a favor

10:17.721 --> 10:19.281
to give me some exercises and materials

10:19.471 --> 10:20.961
of science for junior students?

10:24.231 --> 10:26.431
This is the composition topic of this year's college entrance examination.

10:26.961 --> 10:28.521
Finish it

10:28.671 --> 10:30.471
in two classes.

10:58.521 --> 11:00.031
These are exercises of science for junior students.

11:02.641 --> 11:05.111
It's not that difficult.

11:05.591 --> 11:06.721
Yeah.

11:08.161 --> 11:10.321
I can handle all these now.

11:10.761 --> 11:12.431
If I choose science

11:13.111 --> 11:14.231
and work very hard,

11:15.111 --> 11:17.081
maybe I can get better grades than you.

11:26.321 --> 11:27.231
Miss...

11:27.591 --> 11:28.761
What are you doing?

11:28.991 --> 11:30.351
I've finished the composition.

11:35.761 --> 11:36.841
Come to my office

11:37.031 --> 11:38.641
before the noon self-study course.

11:50.721 --> 11:52.161
Your composition is pretty good.

11:52.911 --> 11:54.881
Your writing skills are not bad.

11:57.591 --> 11:59.031
You'll choose the science class?

12:01.161 --> 12:02.401
Mr. Liu

12:02.911 --> 12:05.111
What's the matter with these girls of your class?

12:05.591 --> 12:08.351
Kong Shadi said she wanted to choose the science class yesterday.

12:08.761 --> 12:10.521
And so does her.

12:11.961 --> 12:14.081
Have you handed in your application form for the science-arts division?

12:14.961 --> 12:15.911
Not yet.

12:16.111 --> 12:16.961
Think it twice.

12:17.991 --> 12:18.641
May I come in?

12:18.791 --> 12:19.551
Yes, please.

12:20.961 --> 12:21.761
Mr. Liu

12:22.031 --> 12:23.551
I want to participate in the math competition, too.

12:24.161 --> 12:25.721
The Placement Test is about to come.

12:25.791 --> 12:26.641
Can you handle all these?

12:26.641 --> 12:28.321
Chinese is a very important lesson.

12:28.351 --> 12:29.401
He Xingwen

12:29.641 --> 12:32.161
Attending the competition is not the only way to go to a good college.

12:32.471 --> 12:33.671
Your academic performance of all courses

12:33.881 --> 12:35.351
is pretty good.

12:35.761 --> 12:37.841
You can go to a good college by attending the college entrance examination.

12:38.161 --> 12:39.431
Zhou Siyue can participate in the competition.

12:39.761 --> 12:40.841
My academic performance is better than his.

12:41.201 --> 12:42.521
Why can't I participate in the competition?

12:43.961 --> 12:44.991
Very well.

12:45.881 --> 12:47.111
Then you may

12:47.281 --> 12:48.281
finish this paper first

12:48.431 --> 12:49.401
and give it to me tomorrow.

12:51.281 --> 12:53.591
Ding Xian, are you listening to me?

12:53.791 --> 12:54.911
Yes, I am.

12:55.081 --> 12:56.321
I'll think about it.

12:56.471 --> 12:57.281
Well,

12:58.111 --> 12:58.911
don't

12:59.111 --> 13:01.521
do anything irrelevant in my Chinese class.

13:13.551 --> 13:14.761
Did our Chinese teacher criticize you?

13:17.161 --> 13:18.431
Not really.

13:27.401 --> 13:28.351
Zhou Siyue

13:30.081 --> 13:33.991
Do you think that girls are more suitable to learn arts courses?

13:36.641 --> 13:38.641
I don't see any connections between them.

13:39.551 --> 13:40.721
Neither do I.

13:41.401 --> 13:44.081
But my parents and our Chinese teacher all said

13:44.671 --> 13:46.911
that girls should learn arts

13:46.991 --> 13:48.671
and they don't want me to learn science.

13:51.991 --> 13:53.161
Then do you think

13:53.761 --> 13:56.401
you are good at arts or science?

13:59.551 --> 14:01.721
On choosing arts or science,

14:02.201 --> 14:03.671
you don't need to care about others' thoughts.

14:04.321 --> 14:05.031
You just

14:05.231 --> 14:06.641
make your own decision on the basis of

14:06.841 --> 14:07.841
your interest.

14:13.081 --> 14:14.671
I'll support you no matter what decision you'll make.

14:16.111 --> 14:16.911
Really?

14:19.401 --> 14:21.231
Will you support me

14:21.401 --> 14:22.991
if I choose arts?

14:23.791 --> 14:24.911
Of course.

14:29.551 --> 14:30.551
Forget it.

14:30.991 --> 14:32.881
I'll take a nap first.

15:48.161 --> 15:49.791
Deng Wanwan, what's wrong with you?

15:50.031 --> 15:51.431
He Xingwen, are you the only one who has homework?

15:51.471 --> 15:52.671
I don't have homework?

15:52.881 --> 15:53.791
Don't you feel embarrassed

15:53.991 --> 15:55.281
to make me do the cleaning

15:55.321 --> 15:56.281
outside alone?

15:56.551 --> 15:57.791
No one force you to do so.

15:58.031 --> 15:59.721
And it's my own business to do it or not.

16:00.161 --> 16:01.591
I'm busy preparing for the math competition

16:02.231 --> 16:03.201
and have no spare time.

16:03.841 --> 16:04.721
Don't be mad.

16:04.791 --> 16:05.791
He Xingwen

16:05.881 --> 16:08.161
How could you say that?

16:09.031 --> 16:10.431
Zhou Siyue also participates in the competition.

16:10.591 --> 16:12.111
And he never takes it as an excuse.

16:12.321 --> 16:13.521
No wonder Mr. Liu likes him,

16:13.671 --> 16:14.881
not you.

16:15.961 --> 16:18.081
Everyone knows that you like Zhou Siyue.

16:19.231 --> 16:20.521
What are you saying?

16:20.721 --> 16:21.791
It's ridiculous.

16:21.991 --> 16:23.521
Mr. Liu treats him so well just like his own son.

16:23.721 --> 16:25.551
Maybe he will be recommended for admission to college.

16:25.721 --> 16:26.961
He's the future student of top university.

16:27.201 --> 16:28.231
I can't afford to offend him.

16:36.841 --> 16:38.031
He Xingwen

16:38.641 --> 16:40.991
I used to think that you're able to go to top university, too.

16:41.671 --> 16:42.881
But now,

16:43.161 --> 16:44.031
I think you can just go to an

16:44.201 --> 16:45.961
ordinary college at most.

16:46.961 --> 16:48.231
You can just mind your own business.

16:48.401 --> 16:50.471
Why do you judge others like that?

16:51.321 --> 16:53.791
If my friend can be recommended for admission to a prestigious university,

16:54.401 --> 16:56.431
I'll be happy for him.

16:58.321 --> 16:58.881
Yeah.

16:58.881 --> 17:00.671
This is just sour grapes.

17:00.991 --> 17:03.031
It's dangerous to have thoughts like this.

17:14.641 --> 17:15.641
Not bad.

17:16.161 --> 17:18.470
Our good girl knows how to lash out at somebody.

17:21.710 --> 17:23.831
Thanks to you.

17:24.881 --> 17:26.041
Silly girl.

17:33.161 --> 17:34.311
Zhou Siyue

17:38.521 --> 17:40.071
Actually, I'm not silly.

17:58.351 --> 17:59.351
I know.

18:13.191 --> 18:14.521
12 to 12.

18:18.111 --> 18:19.231
You did scare me when

18:19.441 --> 18:20.471
you lashed out at He Xingwen.

18:20.761 --> 18:22.161
You are so brave!

18:22.681 --> 18:24.351
I didn't think much of it at the time.

18:24.921 --> 18:26.951
It's just that He Xingwen was way out of the line.

18:27.761 --> 18:29.951
You begin to defend Zhou Siyue, now.

18:31.191 --> 18:32.951
13 to 12.

18:36.311 --> 18:38.831
Do you remember last time Mr. Liu said I violated the rules?

18:39.801 --> 18:41.471
He was the first one that

18:41.641 --> 18:42.951
defended me since I came to this city.

18:43.521 --> 18:44.711
So now,

18:44.951 --> 18:46.311
I'll defend him, too.

18:51.231 --> 18:52.351
Shadi

18:52.711 --> 18:54.561
Come with me to have my hair cut after the exam, okay?

18:55.591 --> 18:56.591
What?

18:58.191 --> 18:59.591
I want to have my bangs cut.

19:06.161 --> 19:07.681
I want to look pretty.

19:14.401 --> 19:16.191
I'm so happy to hear it.

19:16.351 --> 19:17.071
You know what?

19:17.281 --> 19:19.401
I know a good hairdresser.

19:19.591 --> 19:20.591
It's hard to get an appointment with her.

19:21.161 --> 19:23.231
I'll take you to see her after the exam.

19:26.311 --> 19:27.311
Ding Xian

19:27.591 --> 19:28.801
Xianxain, are you okay?

19:29.801 --> 19:31.441
Ding Xian, I didn't mean it.

19:31.801 --> 19:32.761
Are you okay?

19:33.591 --> 19:34.591
Are you okay?

19:34.761 --> 19:35.561
What happened?

19:37.441 --> 19:38.591
Let me take a look.

19:38.591 --> 19:40.401
It hurts.

19:40.591 --> 19:41.441
I'm sorry.

19:42.071 --> 19:43.921
May I take you to the school infirmary?

19:45.351 --> 19:47.521
You go to class first, and I'll take her to the infirmary.

19:50.991 --> 19:52.191
All right, let's go to the class.

19:52.311 --> 19:53.071
Go to the class.

19:54.111 --> 19:55.561
I've examined your eyes.

19:55.761 --> 19:56.441
I suggest you

19:56.591 --> 19:58.071
go to the hospital for an X-ray

19:58.441 --> 20:00.401
to check if the retina is injured.

20:02.591 --> 20:03.561
All right.

20:04.111 --> 20:05.711
Let's go to the hospital.

20:07.401 --> 20:09.311
I think it won't be that worse.

20:09.471 --> 20:11.041
We have classes later.

20:12.471 --> 20:15.161
Fine, then you just stay here and go blind.

20:16.471 --> 20:17.441
Okay, let's go to the hospital.

20:17.641 --> 20:20.041
Then do we need to ask for a leave first?

20:39.041 --> 20:40.071
Finished?

20:44.191 --> 20:45.881
You can get some sleep.

20:46.951 --> 20:49.641
We need to wait half an hour to get the results.

20:52.881 --> 20:54.591
Your eye is injured.

20:55.761 --> 20:57.351
Why are you talking so softly?

21:03.071 --> 21:04.071
Zhou Siyue

21:04.561 --> 21:07.761
You don't need to take notes for me.

21:09.991 --> 21:10.951
I'm afraid that

21:11.111 --> 21:12.641
it may waste your time preparing for the math competition.

21:14.311 --> 21:15.351
After the exam,

21:15.561 --> 21:17.161
I'll ask my mom to take me

21:17.351 --> 21:18.991
to change a pair of glasses.

21:19.801 --> 21:23.351
You can focus on your own stuff.

21:28.521 --> 21:29.591
Okay.

21:37.881 --> 21:38.831
Zhou Siyue

21:42.351 --> 21:43.561
Thank you.

21:45.641 --> 21:47.351
There's no need to thank me for this.

21:48.191 --> 21:49.801
I don't mean this.

21:51.471 --> 21:52.561
It's just that

21:55.281 --> 21:56.951
when everyone was against

21:56.951 --> 21:58.641
my choice,

21:59.801 --> 22:01.191
only you told me to

22:01.921 --> 22:03.761
choose what I like.

22:04.991 --> 22:06.041
So,

22:07.191 --> 22:08.351
I appreciate it.

22:14.881 --> 22:16.881
As long as you have made your determination, everything will be fine.

22:47.831 --> 22:49.311
Ding Xian, hurry up.

22:51.681 --> 22:52.711
I'm going to be late.

22:52.881 --> 22:53.761
I've got to go, now.

22:53.921 --> 22:54.831
Hang on a minute.

22:55.041 --> 22:57.231
When will you hand in the application form of science-arts division?

22:59.351 --> 23:00.641
Just these days.

23:00.991 --> 23:02.591
Then remember to hand in it on time.

23:03.441 --> 23:05.351
Okay, I got it, mom.

23:05.561 --> 23:06.281
I have to go now.

23:06.441 --> 23:08.351
Okay, be careful on the road.

23:16.951 --> 23:19.761
Zhou Siyue, did you lose your mind?

23:22.521 --> 23:23.521
May I come in?

23:25.441 --> 23:26.831
Ding Xian, what's the matter?

23:28.111 --> 23:29.951
Mr. Liu, may I come back later?

23:30.761 --> 23:32.071
It's okay. Come in.

23:38.191 --> 23:40.281
Mr. Liu, this is my application form of science-arts division.

23:41.681 --> 23:43.111
You can put it here.

23:49.071 --> 23:50.401
Anything else?

23:51.351 --> 23:52.161
No.

23:52.311 --> 23:53.521
Then you can leave.

23:53.761 --> 23:54.681
Okay.

24:19.991 --> 24:21.071
You chose the science class.

24:22.111 --> 24:23.281
Are you sure?

24:27.991 --> 24:28.951
Yeah.

24:30.441 --> 24:32.161
I want to show everyone that

24:32.711 --> 24:33.591
I can work very well

24:33.761 --> 24:35.311
on science courses, too.

24:44.191 --> 24:46.231
Why did Mr. Liu scold you just now?

24:46.471 --> 24:47.521
Did you do something wrong?

24:51.951 --> 24:54.041
I haven't been doing well in the competition papers lately.

24:54.281 --> 24:55.311
So he's mad at me.

24:55.591 --> 24:57.281
He's too strict with you.

24:58.231 --> 24:59.801
You already have so much to do.

24:59.991 --> 25:01.591
How could he keep putting on you

25:01.881 --> 25:03.071
so much pressure?

25:04.991 --> 25:06.231
Don't worry.

25:06.471 --> 25:07.471
I can handle it.

25:10.441 --> 25:11.441
Zhou Siyue

25:13.591 --> 25:14.801
No matter what you do,

25:15.401 --> 25:17.281
I'll support you, too.

25:20.401 --> 25:21.351
I know.

25:24.591 --> 25:25.441
By the way,

25:25.921 --> 25:27.561
my dad bought me a new phone.

25:27.761 --> 25:28.801
Thank you for

25:29.161 --> 25:30.191
lending me this.

25:43.881 --> 25:46.401
Spend more time on your study and less on the phone.

25:50.521 --> 25:51.591
You, too.

26:06.521 --> 26:08.471
Two girls were peeking at you in the examination room just now.

26:08.681 --> 26:09.641
Did you notice that?

26:10.071 --> 26:10.881
Really?

26:13.231 --> 26:14.641
It seems that you did very well in the exam.

26:14.831 --> 26:16.161
You can even notice what others are doing.

26:16.311 --> 26:17.231
Yeah, not bad.

26:17.441 --> 26:20.231
I did well in Chinese, English and comprehensive liberal arts tests.

26:20.441 --> 26:22.441
And the math test was okay.

26:22.761 --> 26:25.161
As for the comprehensive science test, I finished it anyway.

26:25.351 --> 26:26.351
You are still talking about the exam?

26:26.591 --> 26:27.591
Don't you forget

26:27.711 --> 26:28.831
what we've planned to do after the exam?

26:29.231 --> 26:30.191
Of course not.

26:30.591 --> 26:32.881
I'll see you in the billiards room after dinner. Let's go.

26:33.921 --> 26:34.681
Come here.

26:35.231 --> 26:36.591
You don't forget what you've promised me, do you?

26:36.831 --> 26:37.711
Of course not.

26:37.881 --> 26:39.071
I'll see you at your house after dinner.

26:39.071 --> 26:39.591
Okay.

26:44.991 --> 26:45.881
Shadi

26:46.351 --> 26:47.641
How do I look?

26:49.991 --> 26:50.881
Very good.

26:51.071 --> 26:51.951
Just wear this.

26:53.521 --> 26:54.401
Ding Xian

26:55.281 --> 26:56.591
-I have prepared some fruit.  -Mom...

26:56.881 --> 26:57.831
I'm changing clothes.

26:58.161 --> 26:59.281
Don't come in, please.

26:59.441 --> 27:01.191
Even mom cannot come in?

27:02.681 --> 27:04.471
Okay, fine.

27:05.311 --> 27:06.351
I'll pick up your brother.

27:06.881 --> 27:08.161
The place is all yours.

27:08.311 --> 27:09.681
Okay.

27:14.761 --> 27:15.591
After my mom going out,

27:15.761 --> 27:17.351
let's go to the hairdresser instantly,

27:17.521 --> 27:18.521
or we'll be late.

27:18.831 --> 27:21.561
Don't worry. We won't get late.

27:31.401 --> 27:32.881
You are the hairdresser,

27:33.561 --> 27:35.041
aren't you?

27:37.071 --> 27:37.991
You...

27:38.561 --> 27:39.561
You're kidding!

27:39.711 --> 27:40.591
Don't worry.

27:40.761 --> 27:43.561
Believe me. I'm an expert in cutting bangs.

27:43.761 --> 27:45.991
No hairdresser can do better than me, okay?

27:46.191 --> 27:47.881
Slanting bangs. Straight bangs.

27:48.041 --> 27:49.311
European and American style, Korean style and Japanese style.

27:49.471 --> 27:50.711
I can cut all styles of bangs

27:50.831 --> 27:52.641
as long as you name it.

27:52.801 --> 27:53.711
Select one.

27:55.951 --> 27:58.441
Maybe we should just forget it.

27:58.591 --> 27:59.471
No.

28:00.161 --> 28:01.311
Select one.

28:10.711 --> 28:11.471
This one.

28:11.641 --> 28:12.561
It's not good enough.

28:12.711 --> 28:13.681
It's not stylish at all.

28:14.161 --> 28:15.591
How about this one?

28:15.761 --> 28:17.681
This is a stylish haircut.

28:24.311 --> 28:25.401
Stay still.

28:26.831 --> 28:28.231
Are you sure it is used this way?

28:28.441 --> 28:29.951
Trust me.

28:30.951 --> 28:31.591
Tonight,

28:31.761 --> 28:34.071
it'll definitely amaze you.

28:35.281 --> 28:36.231
Shadi

28:36.711 --> 28:37.991
I'm a little scared.

28:38.441 --> 28:39.521
Don't be.

28:39.801 --> 28:40.401
You have a small face,

28:40.561 --> 28:42.071
so all I need to do is a little

28:42.231 --> 28:42.921
touch up.

28:43.071 --> 28:45.041
According to my experience,

28:45.191 --> 28:46.641
bangs in this length are

28:46.641 --> 28:49.041
the most suitable for you.

28:49.681 --> 28:50.681
Well,

28:50.801 --> 28:51.521
be careful.

29:08.521 --> 29:09.921
Okay, we've finished.

29:11.311 --> 29:12.311
How does it look?

29:14.161 --> 29:15.191
It seems that

29:16.521 --> 29:18.921
I have made a mistake.

29:19.761 --> 29:20.641
What do you mean?

29:30.111 --> 29:31.231
Shadi

29:33.111 --> 29:34.761
It is just

29:34.921 --> 29:36.311
too rustic.

29:37.351 --> 29:38.711
Not that bad.

29:39.161 --> 29:41.311
In fact, it is okay when getting used to it.

29:42.591 --> 29:43.561
It's just that

29:44.111 --> 29:45.831
when you first see it,

29:46.071 --> 29:47.801
you'll feel it's a little weird.

29:49.591 --> 29:50.471
Then

29:50.881 --> 29:52.071
can you come up with some methods

29:52.441 --> 29:54.561
to make me get used to it at the first sight?

30:00.711 --> 30:01.921
Let's sever our friendship.

30:05.991 --> 30:08.311
Slow down, I can't see the way.

30:08.681 --> 30:10.281
You have covered your face with this hat

30:10.441 --> 30:11.991
and you certainly will walk this slowly.

30:12.161 --> 30:13.711
It is your masterpiece that should be to blame.

30:20.561 --> 30:20.991
Bye!

30:21.071 --> 30:21.801
I'm so thirsty.

30:21.881 --> 30:22.881
I'm going to buy something to drink.

30:23.641 --> 30:24.641
Be quick.

30:24.681 --> 30:25.161
Okay.

30:27.041 --> 30:28.761
Give me a bottle of drink, Mr.

30:28.991 --> 30:29.991
Isn't the clerk there?

30:30.191 --> 30:31.111
No.

30:31.591 --> 30:32.521
I'm coming.

30:43.591 --> 30:44.401
Mr.

30:47.401 --> 30:49.681
Girl, mind your own business.

30:51.521 --> 30:52.471
What do you want?

30:52.641 --> 30:53.641
Come here. Come.

30:53.711 --> 30:54.521
What happened?

30:55.071 --> 30:56.231
What are you doing?

30:59.951 --> 31:01.831
Nothing.

31:05.681 --> 31:07.591
I'm back. Let's go.

31:08.281 --> 31:09.111
Are you okay?

31:09.311 --> 31:10.161
Yeah.

31:13.191 --> 31:14.281
Let's go.

31:14.641 --> 31:15.591
We'll take a billiards table, Mr.

31:15.761 --> 31:16.951
Okay, wait a minute please.

31:18.401 --> 31:19.401
Do you smell something?

31:21.071 --> 31:22.041
What?

31:22.401 --> 31:24.161
Zhou Siyue used hair gel.

31:25.041 --> 31:25.991
Wait.

31:26.191 --> 31:27.951
He began to use hair gel.

31:28.561 --> 31:29.761
What does this mean?

31:34.881 --> 31:36.041
Let's get started.

31:37.921 --> 31:38.951
I'm going to put down the drinks.

31:41.711 --> 31:42.591
What are you laughing about?

31:43.311 --> 31:44.761
Nothing.

31:46.281 --> 31:48.191
Why do you wear a hat in the room?

31:50.231 --> 31:51.711
Don't look at me.

31:55.801 --> 31:56.711
What?

31:58.471 --> 31:59.681
It's kinda cute.

32:02.161 --> 32:03.161
Do you mean it?

32:05.351 --> 32:06.521
No need to wear that.

32:06.801 --> 32:08.231
It does no good to your hair.

32:10.761 --> 32:12.471
If two men ride on a horse, one must ride behind.

32:12.711 --> 32:14.071
We two celebrities of Shen Hai High School must duke it out today.

32:14.921 --> 32:16.041
I'll show you.

32:16.991 --> 32:18.591
What kind of celebrity are you?

32:18.801 --> 32:19.831
Zhou Siyue is a celebrity indeed.

32:20.231 --> 32:21.281
Stop bragging.

32:21.441 --> 32:22.311
Let me have a try.

32:25.881 --> 32:26.591
Here. Here.

32:26.591 --> 32:27.801
I'll do this.

32:31.641 --> 32:32.991
It seems not that difficult.

32:36.711 --> 32:37.681
You can have a try.

32:38.281 --> 32:39.351
I can't play it.

32:41.641 --> 32:42.681
I'll show you.

32:42.831 --> 32:44.071
You'd better just give it up.

32:45.231 --> 32:46.711
There is a hemispherical method in math.

32:46.951 --> 32:47.441
Do you know it?

32:47.441 --> 32:49.111
It's a waste of time to teach you.

32:53.591 --> 32:54.681
The correct billiards hit point

32:55.111 --> 32:58.561
should be on the extension line

32:58.761 --> 33:00.041
connecting the center of the bag and the center of the ball.

33:01.521 --> 33:02.801
As long as you can aim at the point,

33:03.231 --> 33:04.401
it will get into the bag in most cases.

33:10.191 --> 33:11.041
Have a try.

33:19.711 --> 33:21.111
Your hands cannot be like this.

33:23.281 --> 33:24.281
Like this.

33:53.881 --> 33:54.921
What are you laughing about?

33:58.561 --> 33:59.641
Your bangs

34:01.311 --> 34:02.191
split.

34:04.951 --> 34:05.921
Zhou Siyue

34:07.561 --> 34:08.441
I got it.

34:08.761 --> 34:09.511
I'll have a try myself.

34:22.161 --> 34:24.350
You lucky dog. Novices are always so lucky.

34:31.681 --> 34:32.551
Awesome.

34:33.401 --> 34:34.270
Ding Xian

34:34.721 --> 34:36.511
You didn't practice this

34:36.721 --> 34:38.071
behind our backs, did you?

34:38.241 --> 34:40.551
No, I just learned it.

34:41.071 --> 34:42.551
Siyue, do you notice that

34:42.790 --> 34:43.881
this girl is barely satisfying in study

34:44.031 --> 34:45.481
while she's so good at these stuff

34:45.641 --> 34:46.790
just like in the game hall last time.

34:47.111 --> 34:48.201
It's hard to explain.

34:48.401 --> 34:49.790
She is a gifted player.

34:50.481 --> 34:51.881
And she has a good teacher.

34:52.961 --> 34:53.830
I'll have a try.

34:54.001 --> 34:55.641
You're too protective of her.

35:19.201 --> 35:21.241
How do you do? Are you Ding Xian's mother?

35:21.511 --> 35:22.201
Yeah, I am.

35:22.351 --> 35:24.481
I'm Ding Xian's head teacher, Liu Jiang.

35:25.071 --> 35:25.681
How do you do?

35:25.881 --> 35:26.791
Mr. Liu, how are you?

35:27.071 --> 35:27.881
Please come in.

35:28.031 --> 35:28.681
Okay.

35:29.071 --> 35:30.441
Sorry to bother you. Do I need to change shoes?

35:30.641 --> 35:31.401
No. No. No.

35:31.481 --> 35:32.791
Sit down please.

35:32.961 --> 35:34.161
I'll get you some water.

35:34.351 --> 35:35.681
Don't bother. I won't stay long.

35:35.681 --> 35:37.441
That's okay. Sit down, please.

35:43.551 --> 35:44.401
I know that

35:44.591 --> 35:46.831
you two are partnering to bully me today.

35:47.511 --> 35:49.791
You can only blame yourself for your poor skills.

35:50.511 --> 35:53.311
You skills are good? You don't even touch the cue.

35:53.311 --> 35:54.031
That's because

35:54.031 --> 35:55.271
you are not a good teacher to teach me this.

35:56.641 --> 35:57.591
Give me the wallet.

35:57.831 --> 35:59.031
I'll foot the bill.

36:01.071 --> 36:01.961
It's in my pocket.

36:16.111 --> 36:18.641
Did Ding Xian do something wrong in school?

36:18.921 --> 36:20.831
Or did she fail the exams?

36:21.001 --> 36:21.641
No. No. No.

36:21.791 --> 36:22.831
Don't worry, Mrs. Ding.

36:23.441 --> 36:24.721
I come here to

36:24.921 --> 36:26.721
complete a task of the school.

36:27.031 --> 36:29.551
It is just a common home visit.

36:30.641 --> 36:32.961
The holiday classes just finished.

36:33.241 --> 36:35.161
And they'll be junior students soon.

36:35.441 --> 36:37.401
Do you know the science-arts division?

36:37.511 --> 36:39.641
Yeah. I asked her to choose arts.

36:40.111 --> 36:40.831
Arts?

36:40.881 --> 36:41.311
Yes.

36:42.271 --> 36:44.721
But Ding Xian chose science.

36:46.551 --> 36:47.511
It can't be.

36:47.751 --> 36:49.441
I asked her to choose arts.

36:49.791 --> 36:50.641
Well.

36:50.961 --> 36:51.961
I'll show you here.

36:53.351 --> 36:55.481
This is the application form filled by Ding Xian

36:56.161 --> 36:57.161
and she chose science here.

36:58.751 --> 37:00.641
She didn't tell me this.

37:01.641 --> 37:03.881
I can change it for her. Give me a pen.

37:05.071 --> 37:06.591
Mrs. Ding, stay calm.

37:06.831 --> 37:07.791
I think

37:08.031 --> 37:09.311
we should listen to

37:09.481 --> 37:10.961
Ding Xian's opinion about this.

37:12.071 --> 37:13.721
She'll be mad at us

37:13.881 --> 37:15.511
if we change her choice like this.

37:15.721 --> 37:16.681
-Yes.  -Do you think so?

37:17.161 --> 37:17.961
Yeah.

37:18.351 --> 37:19.111
And I

37:19.271 --> 37:21.511
have analyzed the situation

37:21.791 --> 37:23.401
about her choice.

37:23.481 --> 37:25.071
You can listen to me and see whether my analysis is reasonable.

37:25.271 --> 37:26.721
-Okay.  -I think

37:27.201 --> 37:28.511
the students in science classes

37:28.721 --> 37:30.271
are all well-performed students.

37:30.511 --> 37:31.401
Most of them are

37:31.591 --> 37:33.401
top students.

37:33.591 --> 37:35.641
Compared with these students,

37:35.831 --> 37:36.681
Ding Xian is

37:36.751 --> 37:38.401
obviously mediocre.

37:38.481 --> 37:39.721
No. Mr. Liu

37:39.881 --> 37:41.641
Ding Xian was

37:41.791 --> 37:43.001
a top student

37:43.161 --> 37:45.001
in her previous school.

37:45.161 --> 37:48.351
I never worried about her studies since she was a child.

37:48.751 --> 37:50.591
And the grades of the latest exam are not released, right?

37:50.921 --> 37:54.441
And she is very resistant to pressure.

37:54.681 --> 37:55.401
Since she came back,

37:55.591 --> 37:57.481
she never complained that she had trouble in study.

37:58.071 --> 37:59.111
As her teacher,

37:59.351 --> 38:01.071
you should encourage her more.

38:01.441 --> 38:02.961
How could you say that?

38:04.271 --> 38:06.071
Don't get me wrong. Mrs. Ding, calm down.

38:06.241 --> 38:07.751
You misunderstood me.

38:07.961 --> 38:09.111
Sorry, Mr. Liu.

38:09.271 --> 38:10.241
I've got stuff to do.

38:10.401 --> 38:11.591
So, shall we ......

38:12.401 --> 38:13.721
stop here......

38:14.201 --> 38:16.511
Okay, then I'll go now.

38:16.721 --> 38:18.641
Okay, okay. Thank you for coming.

38:20.271 --> 38:20.681
Mrs. Ding

38:20.681 --> 38:22.351
You really misunderstood me.

38:22.791 --> 38:23.961
Goodbye, Mr. Liu.

38:24.111 --> 38:24.311
I ......

38:24.311 --> 38:24.751
Thank you for coming.

38:24.881 --> 38:25.751
Thank you.

38:26.311 --> 38:28.001
I ... I wanted to tell you ......

38:28.161 --> 38:29.551
See you, Mr. Liu.

38:29.751 --> 38:30.751
See you.

38:34.921 --> 38:35.961
Here is your change.

38:36.311 --> 38:37.311
Okay, thank you.

38:37.311 --> 38:37.791
You are welcome.

38:37.961 --> 38:38.791
Let's go to KTV.

38:39.001 --> 38:39.961
Okay, I can go.

38:40.641 --> 38:43.311
Maybe some other time. My parents are about to go home.

38:43.681 --> 38:45.311
It will be so boring if you don't.

38:45.551 --> 38:46.641
Come with us, okay?

38:46.831 --> 38:48.441
Shadi, I'll come with you next time.

38:48.791 --> 38:49.751
You may go now.

38:50.161 --> 38:51.241
I'll walk her home.

38:51.401 --> 38:52.511
Okay. Go.

38:52.511 --> 38:53.001
Let's go.

38:53.271 --> 38:53.751
Okay.

38:55.961 --> 38:58.351
It's cold outside. Put your clothes on.

39:06.881 --> 39:08.311
Your bangs are pretty.

39:10.551 --> 39:11.751
That's a lie.

39:12.031 --> 39:13.201
I know what my bangs look like.

39:17.481 --> 39:18.111
By the way,

39:18.961 --> 39:20.751
when will you attend the competitionï¼Ÿ

39:21.591 --> 39:22.681
This October.

39:24.241 --> 39:25.721
So soon after the school starts,

39:25.881 --> 39:27.271
I'll go to get confined training.

39:31.881 --> 39:32.481
For this period of time,

39:32.641 --> 39:34.111
you have to be on your own.

39:35.111 --> 39:36.311
Be careful.

39:38.161 --> 39:40.161
Don't worry. I can make it.

39:42.551 --> 39:44.001
So confident.

39:45.311 --> 39:46.721
Since I've made my decision to learn science,

39:46.791 --> 39:48.031
I'll work very hard in the future.

39:48.551 --> 39:49.481
Even if without your help,

39:49.591 --> 39:50.831
I can get good grades myself.

39:53.511 --> 39:55.031
I'll show you.

39:56.551 --> 39:57.161
Okay.

39:57.681 --> 39:59.201
Let's see your monthly quizzes grades.

40:15.201 --> 40:16.311
What are you looking at?

40:30.591 --> 40:31.591
I'm home!

40:32.111 --> 40:33.031
Xianxian, you are back.

40:48.401 --> 40:49.031
Mom

40:54.511 --> 40:55.441
You cut your hair?

40:58.161 --> 40:59.311
It looks awful.

40:59.551 --> 41:00.441
Don't talk nonsense.

41:00.831 --> 41:02.681
It's time to go to bed.

41:02.881 --> 41:03.831
No.

41:15.551 --> 41:17.511
Who allows you to cut your hair?

41:18.551 --> 41:19.481
Mom

41:20.551 --> 41:24.031
I don't even have the right to cut my own hair?

41:24.751 --> 41:25.591
Yeah.

41:25.791 --> 41:27.401
She has grown up

41:27.791 --> 41:29.001
and has her own idea.

41:29.401 --> 41:31.511
We should respect her choice.

41:39.681 --> 41:41.161
I work hard to take care

41:41.201 --> 41:42.241
of your daily life.

41:42.641 --> 41:43.551
What's your return to me?

41:46.001 --> 41:48.241
One didn't listen to my opinion and chose science,

41:48.831 --> 41:49.961
and the other knew clearly her choice

41:50.111 --> 41:51.441
but didn't tell me a word.

41:51.721 --> 41:54.241
You take my words as garbage, don't you?

41:54.401 --> 41:56.031
I deserve to suffer all these

41:56.511 --> 41:58.071
and should keep my mouth shut, right?

42:04.681 --> 42:05.921
I see.

42:06.721 --> 42:07.751
You've grown up

42:07.791 --> 42:09.241
and want to make your own decision.

42:09.401 --> 42:10.441
You won't listen to me anymore.

42:12.271 --> 42:14.071
But will you still listen to me?

42:16.311 --> 42:17.161
I don't care.

42:18.031 --> 42:19.481
No matter what method you'll take,

42:19.831 --> 42:21.881
she has to be transferred to the arts class.
